            <desc_content>
                <paragraph>Enables runtime type-checking of values, via the library <literal>beartype</literal>.</paragraph>
                <paragraph>I.e. <literal>obj = validates_with_beartype(obj)</literal> adds runtime type-checking
                    to all calls of <literal>obj(*args, **kwargs)</literal>, based on the type-annotations
                    specified in the signature of <literal>obj</literal>.</paragraph>
                <paragraph>This is designed to be used as a “zen-wrapper”; see Examples for details.</paragraph>
